2026-01-01 open Assets:Stock STOCK
2026-01-01 open Assets:Cash USD
2026-01-02 * "Label punctuation; is data"
  Assets:Stock 2 STOCK {1,000 USD, "brace } comma, semi; quote \" end"}
  Assets:Cash
2026-01-03 * "Match quoted label"
  Assets:Stock -1 STOCK {"brace } comma, semi; quote \" end"}
  Assets:Cash
